.TH CHDIR 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
chdir \- change the working directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B int chdir(const char* path);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Changes the process's current working directory to path.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fchdir (3crunch),
.BR getcwd (3crunch),
.BR chdir (2)
